## 🛰️ What is FleetDash?

**FleetDash** is a real-time fleet telemetry platform designed to process vehicle location and sensor data at high frequency.

The system separates **data ingestion, processing, storage, geospatial analysis, and real-time delivery** so each part can scale independently.

### Core capabilities

* 📡 High-frequency vehicle telemetry ingestion
* 🌍 Real-time geofence detection
* 🚨 Automated fleet alerts
* 🗄️ Optimized MongoDB telemetry storage
* 📬 Redis Pub/Sub event distribution
* 🔌 Socket.IO real-time communication
* ⚡ Worker-thread based processing
* 🖥️ React dashboard with high-performance rendering

---

