```mermaid
flowchart LR

    A["📡 Vehicle"] --> B["⚡ Express API"]

    B --> C["🧵 Worker Threads"]

    C --> D["🗄️ MongoDB"]

    C --> E["🌍 Geofence Engine"]

    E --> F["🚨 Alerts"]

    C --> G["📬 Redis"]

    G --> H["🔌 Socket.IO"]

    H --> I["⚛️ React Dashboard"]

    I --> J["🎨 Canvas Renderer"]
```

