## 🔐 Security

Sensitive configuration should remain outside the repository.

```text
.env
.env.local
.env.production
API KEYS
DATABASE CREDENTIALS
REDIS CREDENTIALS
PRIVATE KEYS
ACCESS TOKENS
```

Use an `.env.example` file for safe configuration documentation.

---

## 🚀 Development

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Mannsoni8/intership-infotec.git
cd intership-infotec
```

Switch to the active development branch:

```bash
git checkout mann
```

Install dependencies for the required client/server directories and configure your environment variables using `.env.example`.

